  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.4.0 Update ApexTree core to 1.14.0. Add Theme, EnableSearch, EnableBreadcrumb, EnableExpandCollapseZoom, EnableZoomPan, EnableSelection (+ OnSelectionChange event), Locale (RTL/messages), PaddingX/Y, EdgeStyle, EdgeColorMode, node-level CardImagePosition, ExternalLabel, ExpandCollapseOnNodeClick, NodeShadow/Hover, the OrgNodeData org-card model, and the ResetPanZoomBaseAsync method\n\n\t\t\t10.2.0 Update ApexTree core to 1.9.0, add EnableAnimation, ViewPortWidth, ViewPortHeight, collapse badge options, expand/collapse button styling, A11yOptions, Zoom/ExportToSvg/Construct graph API methods, AdditionalOptions for forward-compatibility\n\n\t\t\t10.1.0 Update licensing model, update ApexTree to 1.7.0, add event handlers\n\n\t\t\t10.0.0 Add support for .NET 9 and .NET 10\n\n\t\t\t1.0.2 Fix exception for large datasets on serialization\n\t\t\t1.0.1 Fix issue where chart gets created twice and Add RebuildChart method\n\t\t\t1.0.0 Initial release",
